"Independent services are subject to the requirements of their providers, to "
"the extent that they do not conflict with the client ' s rights to be "
"treated with pharmacies."
msgstr ""
"وتخضع الخدمات المستقلة لشروط الجهات المقدمة لها، بالقدر الذي لا يتعارض مع "
"حقوق العميل في معاملته مع الصيدليات."

#. module: ab_ecommerce_storefront
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ab_ecommerce_storefront.order_delivery_terms_page
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:ab_ecommerce_storefront.terms_conditions_page
